"Assemblée tenue après un défaut de quorum. Le quorum devient alors les trois"
" quarts des membres présents ou représentés (art. 1089 al. 2 C.c.Q.)."
msgstr ""
"Meeting held after a failure to reach quorum. The quorum then becomes three-"
"quarters of the members present or represented (art. 1089 para. 2 CCQ)."

#. module: bf_property_governance
#: model:ir.actions.act_window,name:bf_property_governance.action_assembly
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_governance.field_bf_property_organisation__assembly_ids
