msgstr "General meetings"

#. module: bf_property_governance
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_governance.view_resolution_form
msgid ""
"Au scrutin secret, ce registre dit seulement à\n"
"                                qui un bulletin a été remis. La colonne du vote\n"
"                                y reste vide, et le demeure : les choix vivent\n"
"                                dans l'urne, sans rien qui nomme leur auteur."
msgstr ""
"On a secret ballot, this register says only to\n"
"                                whom a ballot paper was handed. The vote column\n"
"                                stays empty there, and remains so: the choices live\n"
"                                in the box, with nothing naming their author."

#. module: bf_property_governance
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_governance.field_bf_property_vote__choice
msgid ""
"Au scrutin secret, cette colonne reste vide et le demeure : le registre dit "
"qui a reçu un bulletin, jamais ce qu'il en a fait."
msgstr ""
"On a secret ballot, this column stays empty and remains so: the register "
"says who received a ballot paper, never what they did with it."

